@host = http://localhost:5044

### List
GET {{host}}/api/sales-orders

### Create (customer 1, warehouse 1, product 1)
POST {{host}}/api/sales-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": 1, "warehouseId": 1, "lines": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 3 } ] }

### Ship too early (still DRAFT), expect 409
POST {{host}}/api/sales-orders/5/ship

### Confirm
POST {{host}}/api/sales-orders/5/confirm

### Ship, expect { "linesShipped": 1 }
POST {{host}}/api/sales-orders/5/ship

### Ship again, expect 409
POST {{host}}/api/sales-orders/5/ship

### Too many for the stock (create, confirm, then ship), expect 409 Insufficient stock
POST {{host}}/api/sales-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": 1, "warehouseId": 1, "lines": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 100000 } ] }

### Unknown product, expect 404
POST {{host}}/api/sales-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": 1, "warehouseId": 1, "lines": [ { "productId": 999, "quantity": 1 } ] }